.Dd 2026-11-07
.Dt LBTS-WEB 1
.\" Manual page created by:
.\" Guus Sliepen <guus@lightbts.info>
.Sh NAME
.Nm lbts-web
.Nd read-only web interface for LightBTS
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl d Ar path
.Op Fl l Ar host : Ns Ar port
.Op Fl -fastcgi Ns Op = Ns Ar socket
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
serves a read-only web interface for a LightBTS instance.
It shows the list of tickets, which can be filtered by status, severity and tag,
the details and messages of each ticket, and the raw messages.
.Pp
The interface works without JavaScript.
If JavaScript is enabled, htmx is used to update the ticket list without reloading the page.
.Pp
.Nm
can run in three ways:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Stand-alone
By default,
.Nm
serves HTTP itself on the address given with
.Fl l .
There is no TLS support, so use a reverse proxy if the interface should be reachable from other hosts.
.It FastCGI
If standard input is a FastCGI socket, which is the case when
.Nm
is started by a web server or by
.Xr spawn-fcgi 1 ,
or if the
.Fl -fastcgi
option is given, FastCGI requests are served.
.It CGI
If the
.Ev GATEWAY_INTERFACE
environment variable is set,
.Nm
handles a single CGI request and exits.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl d , Fl -data-dir Ar path
Use the LightBTS instance in the given directory or one of its parents.
.It Fl l , Fl -listen Ar host : Ns Ar port
Serve HTTP on the given address.
The default is 127.0.0.1:8080.
If the port is 0, a free port is chosen.
The address actually used is printed on standard error.
.It Fl -fastcgi Ns Op = Ns Ar socket
Serve FastCGI requests on standard input, or on the given socket.
The socket can be the path of a UNIX socket, or :port to listen on a TCP port.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show a help message.
.It Fl -version
Show version information.
.El
.Sh PAGES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It /
The list of tickets.
The query parameters
.Va status
(open, closed or all),
.Va severity
and
.Va tag
filter the list.
.It /ticket/ Ns Ar number
The details and messages of a ticket.
.It /message?id= Ns Ar message-id
A raw message.
.It /static/
The style sheet and htmx.
.El
.Sh CONFIGURATION
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Va web.root
The URL of the ticket list, used to create links.
By default, the script name passed by the web server is used, or / when running stand-alone.
.It Va web.static-root
The URL of the static files.
By default, this is
.Pa static/
below
.Va web.root .
.El
.Pp
The HTML templates in
.Pa .lightbts/templates
can be changed to customize the pages.
If a template file does not exist, a built-in one is used.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Ev LIGHTBTS_DIR
Set the path to the LightBTS data, if
.Fl d
is not given.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lbts 1 ,
.Xr lightbts 7 .
.Sh AUTHOR
.An "Guus Sliepen" Aq guus@lightbts.info
